Settlers!

We have prepared a small but important update for the playtest version of the game. The following changes have been implemented:
[list][*] Fixed a bug where the screen would turn blue after loading a save;
[*] Fixed several other common issues;
[*] Fixed multiple localization errors;
[*] Added a critical error logging procedure as well as an in-game performance stats collecting system, which will help us improve overall optimization.[/list]
⚠️ Please note that this update will render previous saves incompatible with the current build, so you will have to start a new playthrough. We apologize for the inconvenience! 

Finally, a reminder that the playtest is open to everyone, so, if you did not know about it until now, we will be glad to see you in-game and hear your opinion on the project's progress!

